# Secrets — never commit. .astro-dev-edit.json is written by the Settings panel;
# .*.dev-edit-tmp-* is atomicWrite's mid-write sibling, and may briefly hold
# whatever the file it is replacing holds — which is why the dev server refuses
# to serve both patterns (src/server/private-files.ts).
.env
.env.*
.astro-dev-edit.json
.*.dev-edit-tmp-*

